<node id="App Store">
  <data key="d0">App Store</data>
  <data key="d1">geo</data>
  <data key="d2">"The App Store is an application marketplace for iOS devices where users can download and update apps like the CMF Watch app. It serves as a platform for app distribution and updates."&gt;&lt;SEP&gt;App Store is a digital distribution platform for iOS devices where apps can be downloaded.&lt;SEP&gt;App Store is a platform where the Nothing X app can be downloaded for iOS users.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-e2ea28975423f6227a8330d76c202878&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fec2c3e80ab69404ff0b23b014c07483&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9ca8764057d5d820c4c3fb502a440d2f</data>
