<node id="SBC">
  <data key="d0">SBC</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">"SBC is a Bluetooth audio codec supported by Ear (open), which is a basic format for audio streaming."&gt;&lt;SEP&gt;SBC is a Bluetooth sound codec also supported by Ear (1) for audio transmission.&lt;SEP&gt;SBC is a basic audio format supported by CMF Buds 2 for compatibility with various devices.&lt;SEP&gt;SBC is an audio codec format supported by the Buds for audio transmission.&lt;SEP&gt;SBC is an audio codec supported by Nothing Ear for basic audio transmission.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-56220d4c1145af0000fc9cb728dc6db7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b6a5e79a49bc7db2a612f28136aee41c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f443862ed6a46e95ac18dbc4e38f2090&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c8e8ce97e9623a3206989beb9bb64519&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-92e27c35cbd2d81e7710bdeb957abdb9</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
