  <data key="d0">Buds Pro earbuds</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">The Buds Pro earbuds are a type of wireless audio device with specific features like ANC, dual connectivity, and battery life specifications.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-ecb83fc961a06d6a2e205ffa27cd9700</data>
