  <data key="d5">1767407143</data>
</node>
<node id="Charging case">
  <data key="d0">Charging case</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Charging case is a device used to charge the Ear (a) earbuds, and it has specific charging behaviors and indicators when in low battery status.&lt;SEP&gt;The charging case is an accessory for the Buds Pro earbuds that provides additional battery life and storage for the earbuds. It has an IPX2 rating for splashproof protection.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-026c9aac607d8ab10d1f5ae9d51556e9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ecb83fc961a06d6a2e205ffa27cd9700</data>
