</node>
<node id="Network &amp; internet">
  <data key="d0">Network &amp; internet</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Network &amp; internet is a category in Settings that includes options for connecting to Wi-Fi and cellular networks, as well as managing network types like 4G and 5G.&lt;SEP&gt;Network &amp; internet is a category of mobile device settings that manage cellular data, Wi-Fi, and other connectivity options.&lt;SEP&gt;Network &amp; internet is a section under settings that manages connectivity options like mobile data, WiFi, and SIM cards.&lt;SEP&gt;Network &amp; internet is a settings section that allows users to configure various aspects of their phone's connectivity, including data usage, Wi-Fi, Bluetooth, and SIM card preferences.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-65f13477800edffaf85ef49b0eb80982&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-36249177cb5d5f7c720a6f64a0edc813&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-59d089d6dd16ac59cfa0d577b293a12e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3ce2dd4dcddbe486368b957aabc2e335</data>
