<node id="Data Usage">
  <data key="d0">Data Usage</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Data Usage is a category of mobile device functions that track and manage how much data apps are using over time.&lt;SEP&gt;Data Usage is a feature within Network &amp; Internet that tracks how much data is consumed by the device or specific applications.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-8cd614c63bd30923f007ff94a3e7a5d9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-59d089d6dd16ac59cfa0d577b293a12e</data>
