  <data key="d0">Browser History</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Browser History is a category of data associated with internet browsing activity, allowing users to clear or manage past browsing records.&lt;SEP&gt;Browser History refers to the record of web pages visited by the user, which can be cleared through the browser's settings.</data>
