<node id="Geographical Settings">
  <data key="d0">Geographical Settings</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Geographical Settings is a category of mobile device functions that manage location data saved with photos.&lt;SEP&gt;Geographical settings for photos allow the phone to save location data when taking a picture, which requires GPS and a working network connection.&lt;SEP&gt;Geographical settings for photos allow the phone to save location information with images, which requires GPS and a wireless network connection.</data>
