</node>
<node id="VoLTE">
  <data key="d0">VoLTE</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">VoLTE (Voice Over LTE) is a communication technology that enables high-quality voice calls over LTE data networks, improving call quality and connectivity compared to traditional voice services. It requires activation by the network carrier and allows for faster connection speeds. VoLTE is specifically relevant to 4G LTE networks and integrates with video calling features within the Contact application. Additionally, VoLTE supports high-quality video calling, making it a comprehensive solution that enhances both voice and video communication capabilities on LTE networks.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-aecf49d9e86fc2b3fbfb0f065b82e03e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-258395120725348800696992422fd798&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-59d089d6dd16ac59cfa0d577b293a12e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8cd614c63bd30923f007ff94a3e7a5d9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-65f13477800edffaf85ef49b0eb80982&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a9ca0a66c298c31fec04cbfc30d7b98c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7c7e41b65ef7bcc80c8f1decc9bf2928</data>
