  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">VoLTE is a communication technology that allows voice calls over an LTE network, enabling higher quality and faster connection speeds.&lt;SEP&gt;VoLTE is a technology that enables high-quality voice calls over an LTE data network, and requires specific conditions to be activated and used.</data>
