  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">Phone 1 is a mobile phone model that supports certain user operations like case removal and battery saver settings, but does not support NFC or wireless battery sharing.&lt;SEP&gt;Phone 1 refers to a device with specific hardware and software features, including dual SIM support, 4G connectivity, and no expandable storage.</data>
