<node id="Battery Saver">
  <data key="d0">Battery Saver</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Battery Saver is a power-saving feature available on smartphones, including the Nothing Phone, designed to help conserve battery life and extend device usage. It typically activates automatically when the battery level drops below 15%, although it can also be manually enabled through Quick Settings. Once activated, Battery Saver limits background processes and reduces power consumption to preserve battery life, making it particularly useful during periods of low charge. This mode also helps in reducing data usage, further contributing to energy efficiency.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-aecf49d9e86fc2b3fbfb0f065b82e03e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cecbf41a5540f78302f91235b833c7dd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ff9ab0e6b0a19cc3df9b2e42e60f607f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-eb46e252d3a2a9cb08cfababdb615773&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d52fb5275de8c3b54cbe38e612348505&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-abefe8b5c23aeae06eaa603651797d38&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7c7e41b65ef7bcc80c8f1decc9bf2928</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1767407143</data>
</node>
<node id="Find My Device">
  <data key="d0">Find My Device</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Find My Device is a service provided by Google that enables users to locate, lock, or erase their lost or stolen devices. It is a built-in feature available on Android phones, and it is activated by linking the device to a Google account. In order for the feature to function, location services must be enabled, and the device needs to be powered on and connected to a network. This service is similar to Find My Phone and is automatically activated when a user logs in with their Google account. Additionally, Find My Device is a feature of the Nothing Phone that allows users to locate their device under the same conditions—being powered on and connected to a network. The service allows users to ring their lost device, manage its security, and track its location using Google's location services.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-e55e3fed26fabdb52106695b9582ce3b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-aecf49d9e86fc2b3fbfb0f065b82e03e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ff9ab0e6b0a19cc3df9b2e42e60f607f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9dbf1c133d4ea12599adde2c8babfb03&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cecbf41a5540f78302f91235b833c7dd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-eb46e252d3a2a9cb08cfababdb615773&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d52fb5275de8c3b54cbe38e612348505&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ea4524a05ac17de1be9923e9a9dc9c59&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a9ca0a66c298c31fec04cbfc30d7b98c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-abefe8b5c23aeae06eaa603651797d38&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7c7e41b65ef7bcc80c8f1decc9bf2928&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-748aef9e02744a06105085d3fb0c0fd0</data>
