  <data key="d2">SIM Tray refers to the physical component of a smartphone where SIM cards are inserted for network connectivity, and is related to the process of ejecting it on the Nothing Phone.&lt;SEP&gt;The SIM Tray is a component of the phone that holds the SIM card for cellular network connectivity.</data>
