  <data key="d0">Battery</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Battery is a critical component of Phone 1 that powers the device and requires proper care to maintain its performance and lifespan.&lt;SEP&gt;Battery is a phone setting that controls how apps are managed in terms of power consumption.&lt;SEP&gt;The battery is a component of the phone that provides power and requires proper charging habits to avoid deformation and fluid leakage.</data>
