<node id="Charging">
  <data key="d0">Charging</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Charging is a category of phone operations that involves connecting the phone to a power source, with specific instructions on how to do it properly.&lt;SEP&gt;Charging is the process of replenishing the phone's battery, which requires using a safe and compliant charger to avoid damage.&lt;SEP&gt;Charging refers to the process of replenishing a phone's battery power and is a key aspect of maintaining battery life.&lt;SEP&gt;Charging refers to the process of replenishing the phone's battery, and improper charging practices can lead to reduced battery performance and potential damage.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-8238a048f616eaf02f92d0455ae0f39b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a4e6bb17059b6ce78b33dddb496db9d2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f522fc3ced3c136bbb28b287f215d20c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-eb46e252d3a2a9cb08cfababdb615773</data>
