</node>
<node id="iPhone">
  <data key="d0">iPhone</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">The iPhone is a mobile phone manufactured by Apple, which is being transferred to the Nothing Phone as part of the setup process for switching devices.&lt;SEP&gt;iPhone is a brand of smartphones manufactured by Apple and is being used as a source device for transferring data to the Nothing Phone.&lt;SEP&gt;iPhone is a line of smartphones produced by Apple, which are being transferred to Nothing Phone as part of the setup process.&lt;SEP&gt;iPhone is a mobile phone brand and operating system, used as a source device for transferring data to the Nothing Phone.&lt;SEP&gt;iPhone refers to a line of smartphones produced by Apple, and is a source device for transferring data to Nothing Phone.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-aecf49d9e86fc2b3fbfb0f065b82e03e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6165e1e8378c1118b98626013d6262b7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8d629090523155bf0dd12f9021e8a28a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-abefe8b5c23aeae06eaa603651797d38&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a4e6bb17059b6ce78b33dddb496db9d2</data>
