<node id="Call waiting">
  <data key="d0">Call waiting</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Call waiting is a communication feature that allows users to receive incoming calls while on an active call.&lt;SEP&gt;Call waiting is a feature on a phone that allows the user to receive incoming calls while on an active call, and it can be enabled through the settings on the Nothing Phone.&lt;SEP&gt;Call waiting is a feature on the Nothing Phone that allows users to receive notifications of incoming calls while on an active call.&lt;SEP&gt;Call waiting is a telecommunication feature that allows users to receive notifications of incoming calls when another call is active.&lt;SEP&gt;Call waiting is a telecommunication feature that allows users to receive notifications when another call comes in while they are on a call.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-3de9a6eca983da6478af176236f5152b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6165e1e8378c1118b98626013d6262b7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-124df9689f92596c4fbc5e0e680893f1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8d629090523155bf0dd12f9021e8a28a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6b8eb92f55e1f3c041c691be7b6dbda7</data>
