  <data key="d0">Blocked numbers</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Blocked numbers is a feature on the Nothing Phone that allows users to prevent certain numbers from contacting them.&lt;SEP&gt;Blocked numbers is a feature within phone settings that enables users to block specific incoming calls and messages.&lt;SEP&gt;Blocked numbers is a phone feature that allows users to restrict incoming calls and messages from specific numbers.&lt;SEP&gt;Blocked numbers is a setting on the Nothing Phone that allows users to block incoming calls and messages from specific numbers.</data>
