  <data key="d2">Google Photos is a cloud-based photo and video storage service by Google that is used to save screen recordings from the Nothing Phone.&lt;SEP&gt;Google Photos is a cloud-based photo and video storage service that allows users to store, organize, and share media content.&lt;SEP&gt;Google Photos is a cloud-based service where users can store and access their media files, including videos recorded via the screen recording feature on the Nothing Phone.&lt;SEP&gt;Google Photos is a cloud-based storage service by Google that is used to store and access screen recordings made on the Nothing Phone.&lt;SEP&gt;Google Photos is a cloud-based storage service used on the Nothing Phone to save screen recordings.</data>
