<node id="Dual SIM">
  <data key="d0">Dual SIM</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Dual SIM refers to the ability of a phone to use two SIM cards simultaneously, supporting two phone numbers and enabling different network modes such as Dual Standby or active mode. This feature is present in Phone (2a) and the Nothing Phone, allowing users to operate two SIM cards at the same time for network, call, SMS, and data functions. Both devices provide the option for dual standby, where both SIM cards are active but only one can be used at a time for calls or data, as well as full dual functionality, where both SIM cards can be used simultaneously for calls and data. The Nothing Phone supports multi-network connectivity through its Dual SIM capability, enabling users to manage multiple network connections and services like calls, SMS, and data seamlessly.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-77d37b7781a21f9ace596c3bcb0cbfd0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e55e3fed26fabdb52106695b9582ce3b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3ce2dd4dcddbe486368b957aabc2e335&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9dbf1c133d4ea12599adde2c8babfb03&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-258395120725348800696992422fd798&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3060d71588cf955b2b239dbba0bd791d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1bd5bdbf50fdf619063eece8e9e67241&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1d9ff89b42c8123f60ebe4521bfb0cbd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a0028e301a1da668320afc0e2e78601b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-281d19d9c4f252fd5c844c3d467ca398&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e8ab8b542ad8bdfa536d2314963d9701&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fcde7317fc7b036415d89ea81329b232&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c9025d462a4f9ed5f5840d5850b11449</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1767407143</data>
</node>
<node id="System update">
  <data key="d0">System update</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">A system update refers to a software upgrade that may increase power consumption due to integration and optimisation, requiring specific steps to restore normal performance.&lt;SEP&gt;System update allows users to check for and download the latest firmware updates for their device.&lt;SEP&gt;System update is a process of upgrading the software on Nothing Phone to fix issues and add new features.&lt;SEP&gt;System update is a software update released by Nothing Phone to improve device performance and user experience.&lt;SEP&gt;System update is the process of updating the phone's operating system to the latest version, which can resolve issues and improve performance.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-e55e3fed26fabdb52106695b9582ce3b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2af070275f346cb3aabc6679c7791a2e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-34426e6693364728fe244fbfe87a0629&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e8ab8b542ad8bdfa536d2314963d9701&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9168201d4eac75ddffe0059a4394bb79</data>
