<node id="Outdoor Exercise Mode">
  <data key="d0">Outdoor Exercise Mode</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Outdoor Exercise Mode is a setting that activates GPS and other tracking features for activities like running, walking, and cycling.&lt;SEP&gt;Outdoor Exercise Mode is a specific mode on the Watch Pro 2 that activates GPS and allows users to track their workouts.</data>
