<node id="Face Unlock">
  <data key="d0">Face Unlock</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Face Unlock is a biometric security feature that allows users to unlock their phone using facial recognition.&lt;SEP&gt;Face Unlock is a security feature of the Nothing Phone allowing users to authenticate their device using facial recognition.&lt;SEP&gt;Face Unlock is a security feature on the Nothing Phone that allows users to unlock their device using facial recognition.&lt;SEP&gt;Face Unlock is a security feature that allows users to unlock their phone using facial recognition.</data>
