<node id="Fingerprint Unlock">
  <data key="d0">Fingerprint Unlock</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Fingerprint Unlock is a biometric security feature allowing phone access through fingerprint scanning.&lt;SEP&gt;Fingerprint Unlock is a security feature of the Nothing Phone allowing users to authenticate their device using fingerprint recognition.&lt;SEP&gt;Fingerprint Unlock is a security feature on the Nothing Phone that allows users to unlock their device using fingerprint scanning.</data>
