<node id="CMF Watch app">
  <data key="d0">CMF Watch app</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">The CMF Watch app is a mobile application designed to manage and customize various features of the Watch Pro and Watch Pro 2 smartwatches. It serves as a companion application that connects the smartwatch to a user's phone, enabling functionalities such as controlling the phone's camera, managing Bluetooth connections, and receiving message notifications from the phone's status bar. The app allows users to access and sync data with their iOS or Android devices, including health tracking, firmware updates, and weather synchronization. It also provides the ability to manage watch faces, notifications, workout data, and device settings, as well as perform actions such as unpairing the device, pairing with new devices, and resetting the system menu. Overall, the CMF Watch app enhances the functionality of the Watch Pro smartwatches by offering a centralized platform for configuration, data synchronization, and firmware management.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-2666978485c7758b69e3c834ba80fefe&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fec2c3e80ab69404ff0b23b014c07483&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6d88ccae3cdc762688c1e8d90c4e68c4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a1887c3e753e5f27cc1105a32465893f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1f73d28d893bcd51ecb5c4b3b1f54870&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8dbac70984f20a7113387507b57809f2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bf93869f27e0db181fc1e8abda02b165&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2813ffd84d05996e288b7ae91da38439&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f443862ed6a46e95ac18dbc4e38f2090&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c923c17927fa4e291cc287467061e0cf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a93494f099711f42904d9b1378c73449&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1f6c1381dcd623ad5b2ea0b60f6ad95d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a20228c525a0011e08b219ab5989855a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6a6dc70b538423eed2a153e23decae4c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fde4d61094019d5f75532f5f5f817f6a</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1767407143</data>
</node>
