  <data key="d2">Reminder to Drink Water is a feature on the Watch Pro 2 that provides periodic alerts to remind users to stay hydrated.&lt;SEP&gt;Reminder to Drink Water is a feature on the Watch Pro that vibrates the user at set intervals to remind them to drink water.</data>
