  <data key="d2">Heart Rate is a functionality of the Watch Pro that allows users to monitor their heart rate either continuously or manually.&lt;SEP&gt;Heart Rate is a health metric measured by the Watch Pro, which can be affected by how the device is worn and its sensor status.</data>
