<node id="Stress Measurement">
  <data key="d0">Stress Measurement</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Stress Measurement is a feature of the Watch Pro that helps users assess their stress levels through a dedicated function.&lt;SEP&gt;Stress Measurement is a function on the Watch Pro that allows users to monitor their stress levels by wearing the device correctly and initiating the measurement through the function list.&lt;SEP&gt;Stress Measurement is a health feature of the Watch Pro that uses an algorithm to assess stress levels, which can be inaccurate if the device is not worn properly.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-a20228c525a0011e08b219ab5989855a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-76cdae3356bcf4004a71c8e11a80f300&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2813ffd84d05996e288b7ae91da38439</data>
