  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Sleep Tracking is a feature of the Watch Pro that automatically records sleep duration and identifies sleep stages, including deep sleep, light sleep, and wakefulness.&lt;SEP&gt;Sleep Tracking is a function on the Watch Pro that records sleep duration and identifies sleep stages such as deep sleep, light sleep, and wakefulness.</data>
