  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">The Watch Pro 2 is a smartwatch device that offers a range of health monitoring and other functionalities, including automatic brightness adjustment, Active Score, Training Load, and Workout Detection.&lt;SEP&gt;The Watch Pro 2 is a wearable device that can be connected and synced with the CMF Watch app for various functionalities.&lt;SEP&gt;The Watch Pro 2 is a wearable device that supports various everyday tools and features, allowing users to access multiple functionalities directly from the watch.&lt;SEP&gt;Watch Pro 2 is a specific model of the Watch Pro series featuring a vibrant color screen, touch controls, Bluetooth connectivity, and compatibility with iOS and Android devices.</data>
