  <data key="d0">GPS Function</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">GPS Function is a location-based feature that enables tracking of movement and exercise routes, activated when the user begins an outdoor activity.&lt;SEP&gt;GPS Function is a location-based feature that tracks movement and exercise routes, activated when the user starts an outdoor activity.</data>
