<node id="Alarm">
  <data key="d0">Alarm</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">The **Alarm** is a fundamental feature of the **Watch Pro 2** and a built-in tool on the phone, allowing users to set and manage time-specific reminders for scheduled tasks or events. It is integrated within the **Clock app** on the Watch Pro 2, where users can create new alarms using the 'Add icon' and adjust settings such as repeat schedules and sound options. On the phone, the **Alarm** can be customized with various settings, including vibration, silence, snooze options, and repeat patterns. Additionally, alarms can be labeled for easier identification. The **Alarm** functionality serves as a recurring event management tool, offering flexibility in scheduling and customization to suit individual user preferences.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-36249177cb5d5f7c720a6f64a0edc813&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-65f13477800edffaf85ef49b0eb80982&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-34426e6693364728fe244fbfe87a0629&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a6f1bc17eaf113f533442b214ae6b6dd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2666978485c7758b69e3c834ba80fefe&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-128e66067604ae44825d98ba3ed45122</data>
