  <data key="d2">Stopwatch is a built-in everyday tool on the Watch Pro 2 that allows users to time activities for extended periods.&lt;SEP&gt;Stopwatch is a timekeeping tool on the Watch Pro 2 used to measure the duration of specific activities or tasks.</data>
