<node id="5G">
  <data key="d0">5G</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">5G is a next-generation wireless communication standard that Watch Pro may or may not support, depending on the availability of the network and the SIM card.&lt;SEP&gt;5G is the latest generation of mobile network technology, providing significantly faster data speeds and lower latency than 4G.&lt;SEP&gt;5G is the latest wireless communication standard, offering faster speeds and greater connectivity than 4G, and can be switched in the phone's network settings.</data>
