<node id="WiFi">
  <data key="d0">WiFi</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">"WiFi is a wireless networking technology used for connecting devices to the internet, and for data transfer and syncing between devices."&gt;&lt;SEP&gt;WiFi is a wireless networking technology that allows devices to connect to the internet and each other without cables.&lt;SEP&gt;WiFi is a wireless networking technology that allows devices to connect to the internet without requiring mobile data.&lt;SEP&gt;WiFi is a wireless networking technology used for connecting devices, allowing screen casting and file sharing.&lt;SEP&gt;WiFi refers to a wireless networking technology used by the Nothing Phone to connect to the internet and enable features such as wireless casting and device location services.</data>
