  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Earbuds are wireless audio devices used for listening to music or taking calls, and their charging and battery performance can be affected by various factors.&lt;SEP&gt;Earbuds are wireless audio devices used with phones, and can experience functionality issues like low volume or no sound.</data>
