<node id="USB Cable">
  <data key="d0">USB Cable</data>
  <data key="d1">equipment</data>
  <data key="d2">The USB cable is a connection medium used to transfer power between the adaptor and the device, and can affect charging speed and stability if damaged or improperly connected.&lt;SEP&gt;The USB cable is a critical component for data and power transfer between devices and the power adaptor, and is subject to damage or improper connection.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-de2595701f68717f24b26c16e73fef62&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e598990cce04e756caad38b82dbe3eca</data>
