  <data key="d0">Fast Charging Protocol</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Fast Charging Protocol is a method used by devices to charge more quickly, which may vary and may require compatibility with the adaptor for proper function.&lt;SEP&gt;The Fast Charging Protocol refers to a set of standards or proprietary methods used by devices to charge more quickly, which may affect compatibility with power adaptors.</data>
