  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Charging Issues are problems that may occur with the Adaptor or related components, such as overheating, slow charging, or failure to charge, and require user troubleshooting or support.&lt;SEP&gt;Charging Issues is a category of problems that can occur when charging devices, including intermittent charging, slow charging, and overheating.</data>
