<node id="Adaptor">
  <data key="d0">Adaptor</data>
  <data key="d1">equipment</data>
  <data key="d2">The Adaptor is another term for Power Adaptor, used in the text to refer to the device that converts AC to DC.&lt;SEP&gt;The adaptor is a power device used for charging multiple devices, and it undergoes rigorous safety certification and testing to ensure its reliability and safety.&lt;SEP&gt;The adaptor is a product used for charging devices, containing electronic components like inductors and capacitors, and may feel hot during operation due to energy conversion and resistance.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-de2595701f68717f24b26c16e73fef62&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8a9c21c16874759496064e1fb0d09cef&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e598990cce04e756caad38b82dbe3eca</data>
