  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">ChatGPT is a category of AI technology provided through the Nothing X app, offering conversational capabilities and voice interaction.&lt;SEP&gt;ChatGPT is an AI-powered chatbot platform that can be integrated with Nothing Headphones via the Nothing X app for voice AI capabilities.&lt;SEP&gt;ChatGPT is an AI-powered language model that can be integrated with the Nothing Ear (open) through the Nothing X app for voice-activated use.&lt;SEP&gt;ChatGPT is an AI-powered voice assistant feature that is compatible only with Nothing smartphones, allowing users to interact with the AI through voice commands.</data>
