  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Battery Share is a feature of Nothing Phone that allows devices to share power, but may experience issues such as failure to function or not working as expected.&lt;SEP&gt;Battery Share is a feature that allows a device to share its battery charge with another device, but the Nothing Phone does not support this.&lt;SEP&gt;Battery Share is a feature that allows the Ear (stick) to charge other devices, but may affect the phone's battery life.&lt;SEP&gt;Battery Share is a feature that allows the phone's battery to be shared with other devices, though it may deplete the phone's battery.&lt;SEP&gt;Battery Share is a feature where a device can share its battery with another, but it is not supported by Nothing products.</data>
