<node id="Phone (1)">
  <data key="d0">Phone (1)</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">Phone (1) is a device that runs on Nothing OS 1.1.4 or higher, allowing access to Ear (1) and Ear (stick) settings and features without the need for the Nothing X app.&lt;SEP&gt;Phone (1) is a reference to the Nothing Phone model, possibly used to distinguish between different versions or configurations of the device.&lt;SEP&gt;Phone (1) refers to the model of the Nothing Phone, with specific charging times, temperatures, and physical dimensions.</data>
