  <data key="d1">equipment</data>
  <data key="d2">Qi-compatible wireless charger refers to a charging method that allows for wireless charging of the earbuds, compatible with standard Qi chargers.&lt;SEP&gt;The Qi-compatible wireless charger allows for wireless charging of the Ear (1) case.</data>
