  <data key="d0">Environmental Noise Cancellation (ANC)</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Environmental Noise Cancellation (ANC) is a general audio enhancement feature that reduces ambient noise, though it is not the same as Clear Voice (ENC) which focuses on the microphone.</data>
