<node id="Ear (stick)">
  <data key="d0">Ear (stick)</data>
  <data key="d1">product</data>
  <data key="d2">Ear (stick) is a companion device to Ear (1), offering similar functionality and being accessible via the Nothing X app or Phone (1) running Nothing OS.&lt;SEP&gt;Ear (stick) is a line of wireless earbuds produced by Nothing, featuring various functionalities such as firmware updates, EQ adjustment, and low latency mode for gaming.&lt;SEP&gt;Ear (stick) is a product name for a type of earbud offered by Nothing, which may be subject to various technical issues and settings adjustments.&lt;SEP&gt;Ear (stick) is a product that includes earbuds and a charging case, featuring functions like fast charging, battery management, and Bluetooth connectivity.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-27081652ef7a553b2a6096008ef80269&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8dbcfd0ba7e5f79063be82c76153444e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a1bc8f3ce2d2c5d835ffeade41737ee5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-136bde614c09969c0d7fb82cc253fd47</data>
