  <data key="d0">Serial Number</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Serial Number is a unique identifier for the Ear (1) device, typically found on the box or engraved on the case lid.&lt;SEP&gt;Serial Number is a unique identifier for the Nothing Ear product, located inside the charging case.&lt;SEP&gt;Serial Number is a unique identifier found on various Nothing products, including the Phone, Adapter, and Ear (stick), used for tracking and identification purposes.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-92e27c35cbd2d81e7710bdeb957abdb9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a1bc8f3ce2d2c5d835ffeade41737ee5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-01cde718609da4920ebfa164616b8d87</data>
