  <data key="d0">EQ Presets</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">EQ Presets are pre-defined audio settings that allow users to customize the sound profile of the Ear (1) earbuds, including balanced, more bass, more treble, and voice modes.</data>
