  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">IPX4 is a category of water resistance rating, indicating that the Ear (stick) earbuds are water-resistant to splashes from any direction.&lt;SEP&gt;IPX4 is a water resistance rating for the earbuds, indicating they are resistant to splashes from any direction.</data>
