<node id="Noise Cancellation">
  <data key="d0">Noise Cancellation</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Noise Cancellation is a feature of Ear (2) that reduces background noise, with two modes available (enabled and disabled) that affect battery consumption and audio quality.&lt;SEP&gt;Noise Cancellation is a feature of the earbuds that reduces ambient noise, which may be affected by earbud fit and ANC settings.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-8dbcfd0ba7e5f79063be82c76153444e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-716596cbb2a7e8b3702d6ceb7f52724e</data>
