<node id="Personalised ANC">
  <data key="d0">Personalised ANC</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Personalised ANC is a feature in Ear (2) that uses an algorithm to create a noise cancellation profile based on the user's ear canal shape for a customized and comfortable audio experience.</data>
