<node id="Personal Sound Profile">
  <data key="d0">Personal Sound Profile</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Personal Sound Profile is a customizable audio feature in Nothing Ear that adjusts sound based on the user's unique hearing characteristics, as determined by an audio test in the Nothing X app.&lt;SEP&gt;Personal Sound Profile is a feature in the Nothing X App that creates a dynamic compensation solution based on the user's unique hearing preferences to enhance music clarity and audio quality.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-26891fa7fbcc5e292dab7ce65ee89518&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3a9c603ca72c28f9a9a34c1ddfef9b9c</data>
