<node id="Timeout Feature">
  <data key="d0">Timeout Feature</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Timeout Feature is a function in Ear (2) that automatically turns off the earbuds after a period of inactivity, either 10 minutes if fully charged or 60 minutes if not.</data>
