  <data key="d2">Nothing Phone (1) is a mobile phone model that features integrated settings for device customizations related to Ear (2) earbuds.&lt;SEP&gt;Nothing Phone (1) is a smartphone model that integrates with Nothing earbuds and has specific settings for managing audio features and Bluetooth connections.</data>
