<node id="Continuous Music Playback Time">
  <data key="d0">Continuous Music Playback Time</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Continuous Music Playback Time refers to the duration for which Ear (a) can play audio continuously, an important specification for users assessing battery life.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-6e908dc520371478d52528beaf43780b</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1767407143</data>
</node>
<node id="Smart ANC">
  <data key="d0">Smart ANC</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Smart ANC is a noise cancellation feature that works in conjunction with the Smart ANC algorithm, using in-ear detection to optimize noise reduction based on the user's environment.&lt;SEP&gt;Smart ANC is an adaptive noise cancellation technology in Nothing Ear that automatically detects and adjusts to external noise levels to optimize the noise-canceling effect.&lt;SEP&gt;Smart ANC is an advanced noise cancellation algorithm that detects environmental noise and adjusts the noise reduction parameters dynamically to optimize the user experience.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-26891fa7fbcc5e292dab7ce65ee89518&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-026c9aac607d8ab10d1f5ae9d51556e9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cbeb4732200e7559b14badeb7c65f47c</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1767407143</data>
</node>
<node id="LHDC">
  <data key="d0">LHDC</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">LHDC (Low Latency High Definition Audio) is a Bluetooth audio codec that enables high-resolution audio streaming with higher bit rates and less compression, offering improved sound quality and more music details.&lt;SEP&gt;LHDC is an audio codec supported by Nothing Ear for high-quality sound transmission.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-92e27c35cbd2d81e7710bdeb957abdb9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-026c9aac607d8ab10d1f5ae9d51556e9</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1767407143</data>
</node>
<node id="Nothing phones">
  <data key="d0">Nothing phones</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">Nothing phones are devices manufactured by Nothing, a technology company, that support the LHDC Bluetooth audio codec by default and are compatible with Ear (a) earbuds.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-026c9aac607d8ab10d1f5ae9d51556e9</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1767407143</data>
</node>
<node id="Smart ANC algorithm">
  <data key="d0">Smart ANC algorithm</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Smart ANC algorithm is an advanced noise cancellation technology in the Ear (a) earbuds that detects when the earbuds are worn and adjusts to cancel environmental noise effectively.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-026c9aac607d8ab10d1f5ae9d51556e9</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1767407143</data>
</node>
<node id="Gesture controls">
  <data key="d0">Gesture controls</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Gesture controls are interaction methods on Nothing Ear that allow users to control playback, calls, and other functions through pinch or hold gestures, with behavior dependent on the active audio source.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-8c10ba86f3c652add8c1d23db1a9625b</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1767407143</data>
</node>
<node id="Call audio">
  <data key="d0">Call audio</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Call audio refers to the audio output during phone calls, which is managed by Nothing Ear's Dual Connection feature, with priority given to active calls.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-8c10ba86f3c652add8c1d23db1a9625b</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1767407143</data>
</node>
<node id="Audio output">
  <data key="d0">Audio output</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Audio output is the process of delivering sound from a connected device to Nothing Ear, governed by Dual Connection rules and the state of active audio sources.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-8c10ba86f3c652add8c1d23db1a9625b</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1767407143</data>
