<node id="Google Account">
  <data key="d0">Google Account</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">A Google Account is an account managed by Google that enables users to access various Google services, including Find My Device, backup, device management, location tracking, and Android features. It is essential for the activation of Find My Device functionality and is used for device verification, recovery, and tracking on devices such as the Nothing Phone. Additionally, the Google Account provides access to services like Google Pay and facilitates software updates. This account serves as a central hub for users to manage their personal data, settings, and access across multiple Google services and Android devices.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-3a9fb365d0322c82fb6ff52dc4a7925f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cecbf41a5540f78302f91235b833c7dd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9dbf1c133d4ea12599adde2c8babfb03&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-abefe8b5c23aeae06eaa603651797d38&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7c7e41b65ef7bcc80c8f1decc9bf2928&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-748aef9e02744a06105085d3fb0c0fd0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-41ebb68d062de192afe8e06b1a67a1c4</data>
