  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Data Transfer is the process of moving data from an iPhone to a Nothing Phone, involving specific steps and requiring both devices to be connected via a cable and charged.&lt;SEP&gt;Data Transfer is the process of moving data from an old device to a new Nothing Phone, which involves connecting the devices via a cable and using a Google account.&lt;SEP&gt;Data Transfer is the process of moving data from one mobile device to another, specifically from iPhone or Android phones to the Nothing Phone in this text.&lt;SEP&gt;Data Transfer refers to the process of moving information from one device to another, specifically from iPhone or Android to Nothing Phone.</data>
