  <data key="d0">24-hour system</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">The 24-hour system is a time display format that shows the time in a 24-hour clock instead of a 12-hour format with AM/PM indicators.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-3ce2dd4dcddbe486368b957aabc2e335</data>
