<node id="Airplane mode">
  <data key="d0">Airplane mode</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Airplane mode disables all wireless functions including WiFi, Bluetooth, and cellular data.&lt;SEP&gt;Airplane mode is a setting that disables all wireless functions on the phone, including WiFi, Bluetooth, and cellular data, to prevent interference with aircraft systems.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-65f13477800edffaf85ef49b0eb80982&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3ce2dd4dcddbe486368b957aabc2e335</data>
