  <data key="d0">Lock screen password</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Lock screen password is a security feature that protects a device from unauthorized access, requiring a passcode or biometric authentication.&lt;SEP&gt;Lock screen password is a security feature that protects the device from unauthorized access, and it cannot be reset without factory reset.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-65f13477800edffaf85ef49b0eb80982&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3ce2dd4dcddbe486368b957aabc2e335</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
