  <data key="d1">application</data>
  <data key="d2">Phone Dialer is an application on the Nothing Phone used for making and managing phone calls, including access to call settings and blocking numbers.&lt;SEP&gt;Phone Dialer is an application on the Nothing Phone used for making and receiving phone calls, and managing blocked numbers.</data>
