  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Message Notifications are alerts that appear on the phone, which can be managed through settings to control which apps send notifications.&lt;SEP&gt;Message Notifications is a device feature that manages alerts and messages displayed on the lock screen and in the notification bar.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-748aef9e02744a06105085d3fb0c0fd0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d52fb5275de8c3b54cbe38e612348505</data>
