  <data key="d7">Bluetooth functionality is managed and utilized by the Nothing X App for device pairing and connectivity.&lt;SEP&gt;Bluetooth is a communication protocol used by the Nothing X App for device pairing and connectivity.&lt;SEP&gt;The Nothing X App relies on Bluetooth for connecting to earbuds, using BLE for low-power communication which can be interrupted during calls.</data>
  <data key="d8">connectivity,device pairing,protocol usage,wireless communication,wireless connectivity,wireless technology</data>
