<edge source="Nothing Ear" target="Nothing Phone">
  <data key="d6">44.0</data>
  <data key="d7">Nothing Ear is designed to connect with the Nothing Phone through Fast Pair and other setup methods.&lt;SEP&gt;Nothing Phone and Nothing Ear are products from the same company and are used together for audio and connectivity features.&lt;SEP&gt;Nothing Phone connects to Nothing Ear through Fast Pair for seamless audio and device management.&lt;SEP&gt;Nothing Phone is the primary device that pairs with Nothing Ear for connectivity and enhanced functionality during calls and gaming.&lt;SEP&gt;The Nothing Phone and Nothing Ear are connected as the earbud is designed to be used with the phone and can be paired via the phone's settings.</data>
