<edge source="Bluetooth" target="Watch Pro">
  <data key="d6">51.0</data>
  <data key="d7">The Watch Pro utilizes Bluetooth technology to connect with iOS devices, enabling essential functions such as data synchronization, communication, and various interactive features. It communicates with the iOS phone and the CMF Watch app via Bluetooth, facilitating seamless integration and control. The device also allows users to manage music playback and handle phone calls through this wireless connection. Additionally, Bluetooth enables the Watch Pro to link with other devices, supporting synchronization and sensor functionality. Furthermore, it provides the ability to control camera operations on connected phones. Overall, Bluetooth serves as a critical component for the Watch Pro's connectivity and feature-rich user experience.</data>
  <data key="d8">connection,connectivity,data transmission,device connectivity,device pairing,device sync,functionality,wireless communication,wireless connectivity</data>
  <data key="d9">chunk-fec2c3e80ab69404ff0b23b014c07483&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1937bef2f48d7dfa41b98235ae13df22&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c923c17927fa4e291cc287467061e0cf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6a6dc70b538423eed2a153e23decae4c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b31736155d9fcbf91049d0a9e73805dc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ea57d11556bf408a29dc7c7e37398cc2</data>
  <data key="d10">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d11">1767407191</data>
</edge>
<edge source="Bluetooth" target="Activity Score">
  <data key="d6">6.0</data>
  <data key="d7">The Activity Score uses physiological data, including heart rate, which is monitored via the Bluetooth-connected phone.</data>
  <data key="d8">device connectivity,health data integration</data>
  <data key="d9">chunk-c923c17927fa4e291cc287467061e0cf</data>
  <data key="d10">unknown_source</data>
