</edge>
<edge source="Bluetooth" target="Watch Pro 2">
  <data key="d6">18.0</data>
  <data key="d7">Bluetooth is an essential technology for the Watch Pro 2, allowing it to communicate with smartphones and access features like camera remote control and notifications.&lt;SEP&gt;Watch Pro 2 uses Bluetooth technology to connect with smartphones, enabling features such as camera remote control and notifications.</data>
  <data key="d8">phone integration,wireless connectivity</data>
