  <data key="d6">19.0</data>
  <data key="d7">The Phone connects to the Watch Pro and Ear (1) earbuds through Bluetooth, enabling features such as call ringing and data transmission.&lt;SEP&gt;The phone uses Bluetooth to communicate with the earbuds for volume control, ANC, and other settings. Bluetooth compatibility is a key factor in resolving functionality issues.</data>
  <data key="d8">app compatibility,mobile connectivity,wireless communication,wireless sync</data>
  <data key="d9">chunk-1e7514c9c486c31232321ac43b9689ae&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ea57d11556bf408a29dc7c7e37398cc2</data>
  <data key="d10">unknown_source</data>
