<edge source="CMF Watch" target="Watch Pro">
  <data key="d6">63.0</data>
  <data key="d7">The CMF Watch app is essential for resetting the Watch Pro to factory settings and managing its features such as watch face customization and workout app settings. It is used to connect, manage, and troubleshoot the Watch Pro device, enabling users to pair and control it for various functions. The Watch Pro device is synchronized with the CMF Watch app for weather information and system settings, and it is also managed through the app for updates and other functionalities. The Watch Pro is part of a product line supported by CMF Watch, an organization that provides related accessories and software services to ensure an optimal user experience.</data>
  <data key="d8">app control,app integration,connectivity,device control,device management,device pairing,device synchronization,organizational ecosystem,product support</data>
  <data key="d9">chunk-76cdae3356bcf4004a71c8e11a80f300&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1937bef2f48d7dfa41b98235ae13df22&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6d88ccae3cdc762688c1e8d90c4e68c4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-852b3a0efad903b6a432ebd5e7a404af&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-118d2f64ec32e517a13b31894b48b9ad&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ea57d11556bf408a29dc7c7e37398cc2</data>
