<edge source="Android" target="Nothing Phone">
  <data key="d6">41.0</data>
  <data key="d7">Android is a source device for data transfer to the Nothing Phone, showing compatibility and interconnectivity between different operating systems.&lt;SEP&gt;Android is a source device for transferring data to the Nothing Phone, typically through a cable connection and Google account.&lt;SEP&gt;Nothing Phone is the destination device for data transfer from Android smartphones as described in the text.&lt;SEP&gt;The Nothing Phone is used to transfer data from an Android device, following similar steps as with the iPhone to switch operating systems.&lt;SEP&gt;The Nothing Phone runs on the Android operating system, providing access to Android-specific features and settings.</data>
