<edge source="Settings" target="Camera">
  <data key="d6">40.0</data>
  <data key="d7">Camera access from the lock screen is configured via the Settings menu under Gestures, allowing users to enable a double-press power button shortcut.&lt;SEP&gt;The Camera app is integrated within the Settings menu, allowing users to configure location saving and GPS activation for photo-taking.&lt;SEP&gt;The Camera application is linked to the Settings menu, where users can enable GPS and configure location settings for photos.&lt;SEP&gt;The Camera feature is accessed and configured through the Settings menu on the phone.&lt;SEP&gt;The Camera is accessed and configured through the Settings category, including location settings for photos.</data>
