<edge source="Settings" target="Storage">
  <data key="d6">50.0</data>
  <data key="d7">Settings includes a feature called Storage, which is a sub-section within the Settings menu. This sub-section provides users with tools to manage their device's storage space, allowing them to clean up internal memory by removing temporary files and cache. The Storage category enables users to perform storage optimization and clean-up operations, offering options for managing files and clearing unnecessary data. Overall, the Storage feature in Settings is designed to help users maintain and optimize their phone's storage capacity.</data>
  <data key="d8">device management,file management,file system,memory management,settings hierarchy,storage management,storage optimization,user control</data>
  <data key="d9">chunk-36249177cb5d5f7c720a6f64a0edc813&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3ce2dd4dcddbe486368b957aabc2e335&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-59d089d6dd16ac59cfa0d577b293a12e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8cd614c63bd30923f007ff94a3e7a5d9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7c7e41b65ef7bcc80c8f1decc9bf2928</data>
