<edge source="Settings" target="Nothing Phone">
  <data key="d6">99.0</data>
  <data key="d7">The Settings application on the Nothing Phone is a core and essential component of the device's user interface, providing users with access to a wide range of features and customization options. It allows users to manage various aspects of the device, including display settings, security configurations, system updates, lock screen widget setup, and connectivity options. Furthermore, Settings enables the modification of functionalities such as call waiting, device lock, screen lock settings, and Game Mode. Users can also configure device preferences related to app pinning, notification management, font changes, camera access, and connected devices. The Settings menu includes important sections like About Phone, backup options, NFC settings, and Find My Device, offering comprehensive control over the device's operations and personalization.</data>
  <data key="d8">accessibility,configuration,customization,device configuration,device customization,device features,personalization,system settings,user configuration,user control,user customization,user interaction,user interface,user interface management,user settings</data>
  <data key="d9">chunk-3de9a6eca983da6478af176236f5152b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9dbf1c133d4ea12599adde2c8babfb03&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-01cde718609da4920ebfa164616b8d87&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3060d71588cf955b2b239dbba0bd791d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-124df9689f92596c4fbc5e0e680893f1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8d629090523155bf0dd12f9021e8a28a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b1d82ee9e80b9a4011cc5dfdad909fc2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a6f1bc17eaf113f533442b214ae6b6dd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6b8eb92f55e1f3c041c691be7b6dbda7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-43c5f3a3b39a02f332e40eef921a1f87</data>
  <data key="d10">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d11">1767407162</data>
</edge>
