<edge source="Watch Pro" target="CMF Watch app">
  <data key="d6">97.0</data>
  <data key="d7">The CMF Watch app is a central tool used for managing and configuring the Watch Pro. It is necessary for pairing the Watch Pro with devices, syncing data, and firmware updates. The app provides comprehensive control over the Watch Pro, including managing watch faces, adjusting settings such as volume, and enabling health features like heart rate and stress measurement. Furthermore, the CMF Watch app is essential for updating the Watch Pro's firmware, ensuring that the device has the latest features and improvements for accurate data tracking. The Watch Pro connects with the CMF Watch app to access additional functionalities and advanced features such as camera control and music functionality, which require a connection to a phone. Through the app, users can also perform reset procedures and synchronize data from the Watch Pro.</data>
  <data key="d8">app integration,application integration,data sync,device connection,device connectivity,device management,firmware control,firmware update,settings control,software control,software integration</data>
  <data key="d9">chunk-fec2c3e80ab69404ff0b23b014c07483&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a1887c3e753e5f27cc1105a32465893f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1f73d28d893bcd51ecb5c4b3b1f54870&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8dbac70984f20a7113387507b57809f2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bf93869f27e0db181fc1e8abda02b165&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2813ffd84d05996e288b7ae91da38439&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c923c17927fa4e291cc287467061e0cf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fde4d61094019d5f75532f5f5f817f6a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a20228c525a0011e08b219ab5989855a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6a6dc70b538423eed2a153e23decae4c</data>
  <data key="d10">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d11">1767407184</data>
</edge>
