</edge>
<edge source="Watch Pro" target="Step Count">
  <data key="d6">7.0</data>
  <data key="d7">The Watch Pro measures step count using a Gsensor algorithm, which has an acceptable range of error and may require restarting or resetting the device for accuracy.</data>
  <data key="d8">algorithm calculations,fitness tracking</data>
  <data key="d9">chunk-2813ffd84d05996e288b7ae91da38439</data>
  <data key="d10">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d11">1767407197</data>
</edge>
<edge source="Watch Pro" target="Nothing X">
  <data key="d6">6.0</data>
  <data key="d7">The Nothing X app is used to manage earbuds and potentially resolve Bluetooth compatibility issues with the Watch Pro.</data>
