<edge source="Gesture Control" target="Neckband Pro">
  <data key="d6">9.0</data>
  <data key="d7">The Gesture Control feature is a core part of the Neckband Pro's operation, allowing users to interact with the device using physical gestures like pressing, rotating, and long-pressing the Smart Dial.</data>
