<edge source="Nothing X" target="Neckband Pro">
  <data key="d6">10.0</data>
  <data key="d7">The Nothing X app is used to configure and manage features of the Neckband Pro, including ANC, Ultra Bass, and Equalizer settings, providing a user interface for customization and control.</data>
