  <data key="d7">"Google provides software updates for the Nothing OS, which are checked via the phone's settings.&lt;SEP&gt;Google enables software updates for the phone through the Nothing OS, allowing users to access the latest features and security patches.</data>
  <data key="d8">service provision,software ecosystem,software update,update management</data>
  <data key="d9">chunk-ffe8e5cdde2af69f64b8ce3b5c683676&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-748aef9e02744a06105085d3fb0c0fd0</data>
