<edge source="Find My Device" target="Nothing Phone">
  <data key="d6">42.0</data>
  <data key="d7">Find My Device is a service linked to the Nothing Phone, activated through the use of a Google account, to help locate lost devices.&lt;SEP&gt;Nothing Phone is compatible with the Find My Device feature, which requires a Google account for activation.&lt;SEP&gt;Nothing Phone offers a Find My Device feature that allows users to locate their lost phone, similar to Find My Phone.&lt;SEP&gt;The Find My Device feature is available on the Nothing Phone, enabling users to locate their device and manage its security through the phone's settings and Google account.&lt;SEP&gt;The Nothing Phone includes the Find My Device feature, which is activated through a Google account and enables device tracking.</data>
  <data key="d8">account-based security,device management,device security,device tracking,location awareness,location tracking,security feature,user tracking</data>
  <data key="d9">chunk-e55e3fed26fabdb52106695b9582ce3b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-aecf49d9e86fc2b3fbfb0f065b82e03e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ff9ab0e6b0a19cc3df9b2e42e60f607f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cecbf41a5540f78302f91235b833c7dd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a9ca0a66c298c31fec04cbfc30d7b98c</data>
