<edge source="Nothing Phone" target="Dual SIM">
  <data key="d6">67.0</data>
  <data key="d7">The Nothing Phone supports dual SIM functionality, which enables users to manage two SIM cards for network, call, and SMS purposes. This feature allows for the simultaneous use of two phone numbers, depending on the mode selected. However, it is important to note that while both SIM cards can support 4G networks, they cannot operate simultaneously on the same network. The dual SIM capability is a key feature of the Nothing Phone, offering multi-functionality and enhanced connectivity by allowing users to handle two separate phone lines effectively.</data>
