</edge>
<edge source="Nothing phone" target="Fast charging">
  <data key="d6">9.0</data>
  <data key="d7">Fast charging is a feature of the Nothing phone that enables quicker battery recharging but may increase device heat.</data>
  <data key="d8">charging efficiency,thermal impact</data>
