</edge>
<edge source="Nothing phone" target="Technical issues">
  <data key="d6">9.0</data>
  <data key="d7">The Nothing phone is prone to various technical issues such as overheating, unresponsive behavior, and charging problems.</data>
  <data key="d8">device malfunction,user experience</data>
